---
import CertaintyBadge from './CertaintyBadge.astro';
---
<aside class="cert-legend" aria-label="What the certainty badges mean">
  <p class="cert-legend__t"><strong>How sure are we?</strong> Every fact line carries one of three badges.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><CertaintyBadge level="confirmed" /> Three or more sources, or an official court record.</li>
    <li><CertaintyBadge level="reported" /> Two sources.</li>
    <li><CertaintyBadge level="unconfirmed" /> One source so far.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="cert-legend__l"><a href="/how-we-check-our-facts/">How we check our facts &rarr;</a></p>
</aside>
<style>
  .cert-legend{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-2);padding:12px 16px;margin:18px 0;max-width:72ch}
  .cert-legend p{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px}
  .cert-legend ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:14px}
  .cert-legend__l{margin-top:8px!important}
</style>
